    {"id":"ld_003","name":"Kadmat Beach","state":"Lakshadweep","region":"Kadmat Island","lat":11.2227,"lon":72.7765,"description":"India's first and only sea walking destination — walk on the seabed with a breathing helmet at 4m depth. Pristine coral reefs with dramatic underwater visibility exceeding 50m.","tags":["sea_walking","unique","coral","diving","pristine","snorkeling"],"best_season":"Oct–May"},
